63. Per-company compute sections follow the house template: headline+basis, estimating logic stated in one sentence up front then executed in order, "Stated runs corroborate the picture", "As a sanity check" (money), cross-company comparison with the main caveat folded in — no standalone caveat paragraph (2026-06-11).
64. Name the source even when making a single-source-dependence point ("a SemiAnalysis report", not "one analyst report"); don't open paragraphs with framing labels ("The floor is first-party:") — let the facts carry it (KP's direct edits, 2026-06-11).
