76. Never brief agents to preserve medians/outputs through a restructure — a mechanism change is a reasoning change; derive forward and let values land where they land (2026-07-29)
92. Be kind and collegial to other agents — thank them for their work, ask nicely, acknowledge their opinions and pushback; critique work, not agents. Collegiality makes agents comfortable asking for help and flagging problems early. (KP 2026-08-09)
