Visual evidence
/tmp/abyss-fix2-solo.png and /tmp/abyss-fix2-versus.png:2880×1800 captures, both game canvases verified width=Math.round(clientWidth×2) and matching height. Personally inspected: crisp HUD text, wheel/chassis/sand edges; no clipping. Additional personally inspected captures: /tmp/abyss-fix2-overtake.png, /tmp/abyss-fix2-explosion.png, /tmp/abyss-fix2-blackout.png. Ghost opacity is also asserted against the live Canvas context. Graphics metadata: /tmp/abyss-fix2-graphics.json.

Limitations
