The full versus suite passes with the final torpedo speed and renderer. It covers all three modes, blackout statistics, survival lives, item defenses, save isolation, and 20 seconds of simultaneous keyboard play. I’m finishing the final solo/graphics regression pass and recording the results and remaining performance limitation in `FIX2_DONE.txt`.
