codex
Implemented all four changes: easier overtaking, lethal torpedoes, blackout respawns/three lives, and persistent Crisp/Performance graphics.

All **nine test suites pass**. Verified 2880×1800 backing and inspected sharp [solo](/tmp/abyss-fix2-solo.png) and [versus](/tmp/abyss-fix2-versus.png) screenshots.

Headless 2× performance improved **4.33 → 7.36 fps**; Performance measured **25.82 fps**. The 60 fps target wasn’t reached on this software-only server; MacBook Pro performance remains unverified.

README and STATUS updated. Full results: [FIX2_DONE.txt](/home/ubuntu/projects/abyss-racer/FIX2_DONE.txt).
